      "message": "feat(2d): support 2D Contour on DXF sketches\n\nAdd layer/chain picking, per-chain side and direction overrides, ray picking,\nopen-chain safety checks, meshless verify/stock simulation, and UI/MCP\nintegration for 2D Contour on placed DXF sketch profiles.\n\nFixes #1864",
