    "node_id": "C_kwDOVoU8JdoAKDQ5ZjAzNWZlODgzMDNhMTQyMjJkOWYyY2VjYzA4YjI3NjQ5ZDU1NTg",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-21T08:44:41Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-21T08:44:41Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1864-contour-dxf-sketches\n\nResolve conflicts:\n- geometry.rs: keep the per-chain override block and main's\n  do-not-touch overlap check.\n- project version: main took v73 for #2055; #1864 moves to v74.\n- op_page.rs: main moved header_rows to op_page/header.rs; port the\n  placed-sketch Source entries there, keep main's Selection item.\n- model_link.rs: take main's side.\n\nSemantic fixes for main's new code: pass sketch_contour through the\ncorner-relief yaw entry; refuse sketch picks as 'Do not touch'\nprotection and in rotary face picks; hash sketch picks in the boundary\ndigest; describe sketch picks by name.\n\nRefs #1864\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
