      },
      "message": "fix(sketch): refuse open chains under Boundary edits; group loops per profile\n\n- A mixed closed + open sketch pick with Boundary edits is refused by\n  name: the controls shape closed regions only, and the open chain\n  would ride through an excluded area.\n- can_group_natural groups closed chains only inside one DXF profile,\n  so loops from separate sketches keep their Auto side when only\n  Reverse changes.\n\nPinned by contour_dxf_sketch_mixed.\n\nRefs #1864\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
