      },
      "message": "fix(ui): key sketch highlight and pick-line caches on the sketch world pose\n\npick_highlight preferred the local view_pose over sketch::world_pose,\nand pick_line_memo omitted the sketch pose and drawing. After a stock\nheight change or a stock move, the hover, selected and pick-line\noverlays stayed at the old place. Both keys now read what the build\nreads: the sketch world pose, and the drawing allocation.\n\nPinned by pick_highlight::tests::sketch_highlights_follow_stock_height_and_stock_move.\n\nRefs #1864\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
