      },
      "message": "perf(ui): cache the Geometry chip text of DXF sketch picks\n\ngeo_chips walked each selected sketch chain (length, bounds) and each\npicked layer's chains on every Geometry frame. The chip text is now\nmemoized in sketch_chip_memo, keyed on the entity, its drawing\nallocation, the pick and the display unit.\n\nPinned by sketch_chip_memo::tests::sketch_chips_skip_still_reads_and_track_changed_inputs\nand the chip assertions in\ncontour_dxf_sketch::sketch_frame_caches_skip_still_frames_and_track_changed_inputs.\n\nRefs #1864\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
